{
  "movie_id": 512200601,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 18.5,
      "end_time": 22.5,
      "text": "So, what will you do? Will you accept the agreement?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 23.3,
      "end_time": 28.1,
      "text": "I can't accept a coexistence agreement that pollutes the sea..."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 28.3,
      "end_time": 33.1,
      "text": "Still with this? Volume MAX!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 37.0,
      "end_time": 40.3,
      "text": "We can hear everyone's secrets loud and clear!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 40.6,
      "end_time": 44.2,
      "text": "This is bad! It's bad for both the ones listening and the ones being heard!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 44.6,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "～～!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 47.6,
      "end_time": 50.1,
      "text": "Secrets are terrifying, aren't they?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 50.3,
      "end_time": 56.6,
      "text": "You're all so greedy, yet so small-minded."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 57.0,
      "end_time": 60.2,
      "text": "If you understand, then accept the agreement!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 62.0,
      "end_time": 65.4,
      "text": "How unsightly. The renowned heroic young lady..."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 66.5,
      "end_time": 69.5,
      "text": "...As Neneka said."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 69.7,
      "end_time": 73.3,
      "text": "...We shouldn't have exposed other people's secrets..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 73.6,
      "end_time": 75.0,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 75.3,
      "end_time": 81.6,
      "text": "I don't think that having secrets is necessarily dishonest."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 82.2,
      "end_time": 83.3,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 84.6,
      "end_time": 89.6,
      "text": "Don't say it. Never say that you fell in love with a friend's lover."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 91.4,
      "end_time": 95.6,
      "text": "Love, hate, envy, wanting to possess..."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 96.2,
      "end_time": 99.8,
      "text": "What do you think will happen if you say everything out loud?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 101.0,
      "end_time": 102.3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 103.2,
      "end_time": 106.1,
      "text": "People are inherently greedy creatures."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 106.5,
      "end_time": 112.4,
      "text": "That's why we protect secrets to maintain peace and harmony in the world."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 112.7,
      "end_time": 114.6,
      "text": "We must protect them."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 115.1,
      "end_time": 119.1,
      "text": "There is no room for argument..."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 120.2,
      "end_time": 121.5,
      "text": "Exactly!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 121.7,
      "end_time": 129.1,
      "text": "Now bow down in fear of the secrets. Beg me for coexistence."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 130.3,
      "end_time": 131.7,
      "text": "...However..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 132.1,
      "end_time": 135.6,
      "text": "There may be cases where it's not necessarily so."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 136.2,
      "end_time": 137.1,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 138.2,
      "end_time": 139.0,
      "text": "...Hm."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 139.2,
      "end_time": 140.1,
      "text": "Hah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 142.6,
      "end_time": 145.6,
      "text": "Now is the time to shine, my righteous light!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 146.2,
      "end_time": 149.0,
      "text": "\"Illuminating Creation\"! ...Unleash chaos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 158.4,
      "end_time": 162.6,
      "text": "What's this?! What is it?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 164.2,
      "end_time": 166.7,
      "text": "O-Oh my!"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 168.5,
      "end_time": 173.5,
      "text": "...It seems that those people have something to you and the others, Akino-san."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 175.1,
      "end_time": 176.4,
      "text": "... Huh?"
    }
  ],
